                <pb facs="0518" n="458" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg458"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 6 in No. 322.—Telegram received July 30,
                        1895.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Stern to Mr. Jackson</hi>.</head>
                <p>Have your letter. Aside from the merits of the case, I am detained here after
                    giving 80,000 marks bail, and as yet have not been heard before any court.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Louis Stern</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
